<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Feb c/a surplus 3.3 bln crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish Feb c/a surplus 3.3 bln crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's current account for February showed a surplus of 3.3 billion crowns for a surplus of 36.6 billion in the previous 12 months, central bank figures showed on Monday.</p>
</text>
